## AI support assistant

Before running: 1) edit CONFIG in the “Settings & request” node; 2) connect LLM credentials (Header Auth: Authorization = Bearer KEY), Telegram and Google Sheets; 3) create a “Log” sheet with the columns from the “Log row” node; 4) replace the knowledge base in the “Knowledge base search” node.

Request: POST /webhook/support-assistant {"message": "...", "session_id": "...", "channel": "web"}
